  "details": "Basically since the last update, I am unable to connect in Vrchat. When It work, I get into my home but if I try to go in another world, it would just keep looping on \" Connecting to USERNAME\" and never end. I have this problem with the VR and Desktop mode also if a friend join me, he will sometimes get the same problem when trying to leave the world. If the loop finally end and I get to join the world of any friends, there will be only me in the world and it would say \"Online in the same world\".",
